step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>Martin the Master Gardener</col> in <col=800000>Draynor Village</col>.</col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>Talk to Martin the Master Gardener in Draynor Village.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to 5 <col=800000>Group of Advanced Gardeners</col> members. They are any of the gardeners found near farming patches that tend to your crops. Any of them will work except for <col=800000>Ayesha</col> in <col=800000>Al Kharid</col>, and ones found on <col=800000>Great Kourend</col>. Note: The following is a suggested path you can take to speak to farmers quickly:</col>
step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>Talk to Martin the Master Gardener in Draynor Village.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to 5 Group of Advanced Gardeners members. They are any of the gardeners found near farming patches that tend to your crops. Any of them will work except for Ayesha in Al Kharid, and ones found on Great Kourend. Note: The following is a suggested path you can take to speak to farmers quickly:</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Return to the Draynor Village market and talk to Martin.</col>
step	4	-	Quick guide step 4
line	<str>Talk to Martin the Master Gardener in Draynor Village.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to 5 Group of Advanced Gardeners members. They are any of the gardeners found near farming patches that tend to your crops. Any of them will work except for Ayesha in Al Kharid, and ones found on Great Kourend. Note: The following is a suggested path you can take to speak to farmers quickly:</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the Draynor Village market and talk to Martin.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Travel to <col=800000>Zanaris</col> (with your <col=800000>dramen staff</col> or <col=800000>Lunar staff</col> equipped, enter the small shack south of <col=800000>Lumbridge Castle</col> in <col=800000>Lumbridge Swamp</col>). (If you need to collect the <col=800000>spade</col>, enter the shack without the staff equipped first and collect it).</col>
step	5	-	Quick guide step 5
line	<str>Talk to Martin the Master Gardener in Draynor Village.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to 5 Group of Advanced Gardeners members. They are any of the gardeners found near farming patches that tend to your crops. Any of them will work except for Ayesha in Al Kharid, and ones found on Great Kourend. Note: The following is a suggested path you can take to speak to farmers quickly:</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the Draynor Village market and talk to Martin.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel to Zanaris (with your dramen staff or Lunar staff equipped, enter the small shack south of Lumbridge Castle in Lumbridge Swamp). (If you need to collect the spade, enter the shack without the staff equipped first and collect it).</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Run to the throne room and Talk to the <col=800000>Fairy Godfather</col>.</col>
step	6	-	Quick guide step 6
line	<str>Talk to Martin the Master Gardener in Draynor Village.</str>
line	
