line	<col=000080>Equip your Magic secateurs, run to the end of the tunnel and defeat Tanglefoot. (Turn on <col=800000>Protect from Melee</col> if you have the level for it. You can also lure the Tanglefoot around the mushrooms to the east to be able to <col=800000>flinch</col> it.)</col>
